// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3967956072" "Powers Division? Is everything alright?"
// Answer Text :
"P3557756248" "Mention her husband."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P2812327620" "Oh no!<br><br>Not again, this can't happen again..."
// Answer Text :
"P74944747" "Again?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1126843250" "First James, now Jim.<br><br>Is he okay?"
// Answer Text :
"P2660092069" "Ask about Jim."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2910593574" "Wait... You don't know who Jim is...?"
// Answer Text :
"P1708141697" "Mention James"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P2363626984" "James?<br><br>What about James? I don't understand."
// Answer Text :
"P4029336365" "Tell her he's alive."
// Page Page5 Text :
"P2625493347" "But... He died, I saw the body.<br><br>What is this all about?"
// Answer Text :
"P2799194065" "Mention the wedding band inscription."
// Page Page6 Text :
"P991335346" "How did you know that...<br><br>Is... Is James really alive?"
// Page Page7 Text :
"P2610771594" "Oh my god, James is alive...<br><br>Where is he? I have to see him."
// Answer Text :
"P3582166343" "Deliver James' message."
// Page Page8 Text :
"P1829796262" "I don't understand. Why doesn't he want me to see him?<br><br>I want you to tell him to meet me. I need to see him."
// Answer Text :
"P1925144642" "Mention James' warning."
// Page Page9 Text :
"P1403265890" "Tell him to meet me where we first met. I'll be waiting."
// Answer Text :
"P913116912" "Agree."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P430466921" "You may see a monster, but inside I am still James Noble.<br><br>I heard that I died, over a year ago. My wife and son must know the truth of what happened to me. This is a small request, but it means the world to me. Will you help me?"
// AcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P969376036" "Tell my family that I live, but for their own safety they need to stay away from me.<br><br>Jennifer won't believe you without some sort of proof. Tell her about the inscription on the inside of her wedding band."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3118552718" "Talk to Jennifer Noble"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1928852366" "Until death do you part... Jennifer deserves to know the truth."
// TaskTitle :
"P1819023933" "<color deepskyblue>The Noble Savage</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1156541134" "James Noble tells you about the inscription inside Jennifer's wedding band."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2440754607" "You've talked to Jennifer Noble, you should return to James Noble and tell him that she wants to meet him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1536037960" "She... She wants to see me? I...<br><br>No! NO!<br><br>She cannot see me like this! What will she think? What will she do? Scream? Like so many others?<br><br>Why? Why has this happened to me? What have I become?<br><br>I sacrificed my life and my family so I could protect people, and now I'm forced to hide from the very people I sought to protect!<br><br>What am I going to do?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P921252423" "I can't hide anymore. I'm going to meet Jennifer, I'm going to make the right choice, the choice to serve my family.<br><br>I will need your help."
// SendOffString :
"P3560109845" "Jennifer will not recognize me. Trust me, I've seen it before. People cannot see the man inside the monster.<br><br>But the monster isn't me. If she can hear my voice she'll know me.<br><br>I need you to meet her first, prepare her for the shock of what has become of her husband.<br><br>It's almost time. I know a route to Barnum & Co through the tunnels. I'll meet you there."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

